      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.4,
          "end": 5.64,
          "en": "So, now that we can go to the Meals screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.64,
          "end": 8.67,
          "en": "it's of course, time to populate it with the actual data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.67,
          "end": 11.301,
          "en": "for the selected meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.301,
          "end": 13.92,
          "en": "And therefore, here in selectCategory,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.92,
          "end": 17.31,
          "en": "we should make sure that we load the meals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.31,
          "end": 19.743,
          "en": "that belong to the selected category.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.67,
          "end": 22.29,
          "en": "For this as a first step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.29,
          "end": 24.9,
          "en": "we should accept a second parameter here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.9,
          "end": 27.93,
          "en": "which is the category that was selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.93,
          "end": 31.14,
          "en": "Because without this information it will be quite difficult",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.14,
          "end": 34.8,
          "en": "to find the meals that belong to a certain category.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.8,
          "end": 36.78,
          "en": "So, therefore here, we should make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.78,
          "end": 40.208,
          "en": "that we actually import this category model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.208,
          "end": 44.85,
          "en": "from the category.dart file in the models folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.85,
          "end": 47.7,
          "en": "and we accept this parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.7,
          "end": 49.95,
          "en": "And then here in selectCategory,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.95,
          "end": 53.67,
          "en": "we should reach out to all our dummyMeals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.67,
          "end": 55.8,
          "en": "and use the built-in where method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.8,
          "end": 59.67,
          "en": "which is supported on all lists in Dart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.67,
          "end": 62.94,
          "en": "to filter this dummyMeals list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.94,
          "end": 66.48,
          "en": "Because where essentially returns a new Iterable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.48,
          "end": 69.81,
          "en": "but that, as you learn, basically is a list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.81,
          "end": 74.539,
          "en": "that only contains the items that match a certain condition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.539,
          "end": 77.033,
          "en": "So, to where, you pass a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.033,
          "end": 80.46000000000001,
          "en": "which will be executed automatically by Dart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.46000000000001,
          "end": 84.18,
          "en": "on every item in the list on which where is called,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.18,
          "end": 86.19,
          "en": "so on dummyMeals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.19,
          "end": 88.98,
          "en": "So here, we get the individual meal items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.98,
          "end": 92.1,
          "en": "because this function will be executed once per meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.1,
          "end": 94.25999999999999,
          "en": "in that dummyMeals list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.25999999999999,
          "end": 97.56,
          "en": "And we should return true if we wanna keep that meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.56,
          "end": 99.63,
          "en": "or false if we don't wanna keep it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.63,
          "end": 103.503,
          "en": "in that newly created list that will be returned by where.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.09,
          "end": 107.481,
          "en": "Now, to define a fitting condition here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.481,
          "end": 110.64,
          "en": "let's take a brief look at the meals again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.64,
          "end": 112.5,
          "en": "And here, it's important to note",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.5,
          "end": 115.10499999999999,
          "en": "that every meal has a categories property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.10499999999999,
          "end": 117.15,
          "en": "which is a list of strings,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.15,
          "end": 120.57,
          "en": "and in the end, it's a list of category IDs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.57,
          "end": 124.77,
          "en": "So, the categories have IDs like c4, c5, and so on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.77,
          "end": 129.45,
          "en": "and in categories in our meals, we have those IDs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.45,
          "end": 131.52,
          "en": "and every meal has different category IDs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.52,
          "end": 133.44,
          "en": "to which it is mapped.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.44,
          "end": 135.9,
          "en": "So, therefore here, in the categories screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.9,
          "end": 138.21,
          "en": "where I wanna filter my meals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.21,
          "end": 141.78,
          "en": "I can take a look at my meal.categories",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.78,
          "end": 144.06,
          "en": "and check whether it contains,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.06,
          "end": 148.38,
          "en": "which is never built-in method available on lists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.38,
          "end": 151.41,
          "en": "to check whether a list contains a certain value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.41,
          "end": 155.4,
          "en": "And here, I'll check whether meal.categories contains",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.4,
          "end": 160.263,
          "en": "the category.id of the category that was selected here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.46,
          "end": 163.82999999999998,
          "en": "And that will return true if this meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.82999999999998,
          "end": 166.53,
          "en": "for which this function is currently executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.53,
          "end": 168.492,
          "en": "does include that category.id,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.492,
          "end": 171.45,
          "en": "and false otherwise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.45,
          "end": 173.64,
          "en": "And therefore, the list returned by where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 173.64,
          "end": 175.44,
          "en": "will only include meals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.44,
          "end": 178.893,
          "en": "that do have this category.id added to them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.66,
          "end": 182.49,
          "en": "So here, I'll then call to list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.49,
          "end": 187.14,
          "en": "to convert this Iterable return by where to a real list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.14,
          "end": 191.321,
          "en": "and store it in a variable filteredMeals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 191.321,
          "end": 193.533,
          "en": "or however you wanna call it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.73,
          "end": 197.7,
          "en": "And in the end, it's now this filteredMeals list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.7,
          "end": 199.77,
          "en": "that's passed as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.77,
          "end": 203.219,
          "en": "to the meals parameter on the MealsScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.219,
          "end": 207.32999999999998,
          "en": "And the title, of course, can now also be set dynamically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 207.32999999999998,
          "end": 209.91,
          "en": "and it should be set to the category title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.91,
          "end": 212.85,
          "en": "so we can use this category parameter down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.85,
