          "en": "to access category.title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 216.504,
          "end": 220.68,
          "en": "And with that, we should be able to load the actual category",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 220.68,
          "end": 225.68,
          "en": "and meals data for the category that was selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 225.75,
          "end": 227.64,
          "en": "Of course, now we just must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.64,
          "end": 229.65,
          "en": "that this category parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 229.65,
          "end": 233.643,
          "en": "is also provided when selectCategory is executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 234.84,
          "end": 236.04,
          "en": "So, therefore, down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.04,
          "end": 238.47,
          "en": "where we're calling selectCategory,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.47,
          "end": 240.75,
          "en": "besides passing in the context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 240.75,
          "end": 243.69,
          "en": "we now also must pass in the category,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 243.69,
          "end": 246.49,
          "en": "but thankfully, this category is available here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 247.83,
          "end": 248.82,
          "en": "in this loop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.82,
          "end": 249.93,
          "en": "It's available there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 249.93,
          "end": 254.447,
          "en": "so therefore, we can set or pass this category here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 254.447,
          "end": 258.023,
          "en": "as a value to selectCategory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 259.586,
          "end": 262.38,
          "en": "If you now save this and force a reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.38,
          "end": 264.06,
          "en": "if you click a category,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 264.06,
          "end": 267.126,
          "en": "you can see the title indeed was used here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.126,
          "end": 269.28,
          "en": "And even though it's hard to see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 269.28,
          "end": 271.86,
          "en": "the meals here are now also filtered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 271.86,
          "end": 274.56,
          "en": "and we don't have all the meals being output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 274.56,
          "end": 277.069,
          "en": "And different categories show different titles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
